/Archives/edgar/data/1524472/000152447226000012/xyl-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Xylem is a leading global water technology company with 2025 revenues of $9.0 billion and approximately 22,000 employees worldwide. We design, manufacture and service engineered products and solutions across a wide variety of critical applications, primarily in the water sector. Our broad portfolio of products, services and solutions addresses customer needs of scarcity, resilience, quality, and affordability across the water cycle, from the delivery, treatment, measurement and use of drinking water, to the collection, testing, analysis and treatment of wastewater, to the return of water to the environment.","zh":"Xylem 是一家全球领先的水技术公司，2025 年收入达 90 亿美元，在全球拥有约 22,000 名员工。我们为各种关键应用（主要是水务领域）设计、制造和维修工程产品和解决方案。我們廣泛的產品、服務和解決方案組合可滿足客戶在整個水循環中的稀缺性、彈性、品質和可負擔性的需求，從飲用水的輸送、處理、測量和使用，到廢水的收集、測試、分析和處理，再到水返回環境。"},{"en":"We have differentiated market positions in core applications including transport and dewatering, process water and wastewater treatment, analytics, smart metering, digital software solutions and comprehensive services. Setting us apart is a unique set of global assets that include:","zh":"我們在運輸和脫水、製程水和廢水處理、分析、智慧計量、數位軟體解決方案和綜合服務等核心應用領域擁有差異化的市場地位。让我们与众不同的是一系列独特的全球资产，其中包括："},{"en":"Global distribution networks consisting of direct sales forces and independent channel partners serving a diverse customer base in approximately 150 countries","zh":""}],"markets":[{"en":"Through two closely linked applications, transport and treatment, our Water Infrastructure segment primarily supports the process that collects water from a source, treats it and distributes it to users, and then treats and returns the wastewater responsibly to the environment.","zh":""},{"en":"The customer base consists of two primary end markets: utility and industrial. The utility market includes public, private and public-private entities that support water, wastewater and storm water networks. The industrial market includes customers that require similar water and wastewater infrastructure applications to support various industrial operations.","zh":""}],"customers":[{"en":"Our business is not dependent on any single customer or a few customers, the loss of which would have a material adverse effect on our Company. No individual customer accounted for more than 5% of our consolidated revenues in 2025, 2024 or 2023.","zh":""},{"en":"Backlog includes orders on hand as well as contractual customer agreements at the end of the period. Delivery schedules vary from customer to customer based on their requirements. Annual or multi-year contracts are subject to rescheduling and cancellation by customers due to the long-term nature of the contracts. As such, beginning total backlog, plus orders, minus revenues, will not equal ending total backlog due to contract adjustments, foreign currency fluctuations and other factors. Typically, capital projects require longer lead production cycles and deployment schedules, and delays occur from time to time. Total backlog was $4,615 million at December 31, 2025","zh":"積壓訂單包括現有訂單以及期末的客戶合約協議。交貨時間表因客戶的要求而異。由於合約的長期性質，年度或多年合約可能會被客戶重新安排和取消。因此，由于合同调整、外汇波动和其他因素，期初总积压订单加上订单减去收入并不等于期末总积压订单。通常，资本项目需要更长的生产周期和部署计划，并且有时会发生延迟。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，积压订单总额为 46.15 亿美元"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Water Infrastructure","val":2636000000,"zh":"水務基礎設施"},{"name":"Water Solutions Services","val":2464000000,"zh":"水解決方案服務部門"},{"name":"Measurementand Control Solutions","val":2086000000,"zh":"測量和控制解決方案"},{"name":"Applied Water","val":1849000000,"zh":"應用水"}],"total":9035000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":7472000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":1563000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":9035000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":5209000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1839000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1221000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":766000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":9035000000}},"peers":["PNR","IEX","AWK","ROP","AME"]}}